{"asset_key":"ep5/herohub_story_15411190","episode":"ep5","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"15411190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1541119001:1":{"text":"ホーリンの人たちが、茶色の丸い小さな板をたくさん持っているのですが……","source_cn":"呼临人手里，拿着很多褐色的圆片。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBECBBC1B2AC95DDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1541119002:1":{"text":"ある女性が地面に座っている男性にそれを渡したあと、その男性の土鍋を持って行きました。","source_cn":"有个女人把它交给坐在地上的男人，然后，带走了那个男人的陶罐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0924BF677105976B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1541119003:1":{"text":"ですが、男性はそれを黙って見ているだけでした……どうしてですか？あの丸い板は何なのですか？","source_cn":"但是，被拿走陶罐的男人没有追她……为什么？那些圆片是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81760CBE206B2167","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1541119004:1":{"text":"あれは銅貨といって、この地域で流通している通貨ですよ。","source_cn":"那些圆片是铜币，是这片区域流通的货币。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3994BA76E591557","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1541119005:1":{"text":"つうか……？","source_cn":"货币……是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE09F7E901037542","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1541119005":{"text":"つうか……？","source_cn":"货币……是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE09F7E901037542","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1541119006:1":{"text":"おかね……？","source_cn":"钱，又是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFA20E6E7F5E5AA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1541119008:1":{"text":"そうですね……「通貨」とは、物の価値を量ることができる特別な道具だと思えばいいのです。","source_cn":"你可以认为，“货币”是一种能够衡量事物价值的特殊物品。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DBE8BEA4CDCA68E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1541119009:1":{"text":"たとえば、キラキラカカオ十個で獣肉一枚と交換できるとしましょう。そしてキラキラカカオ一個が通貨一枚と同じ価値だとすると、獣肉一枚は通貨十枚と同じ価値になりますよね？","source_cn":"举例来说，如果十颗斑斓可可能换到一块兽肉，那么就可以简...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F7E6D9D321A1051","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1541119010:1":{"text":"これをもとに、他の物の価値を量っていけば、通貨でそれらを購入することができます。","source_cn":"在此基础上，就可以计算出更多东西的价值，用相应的货币购买。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B40918135B23AA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1541119011:1":{"text":"……なるほど。","source_cn":"……原来是这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11736CC97BD4B8A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1541119012:1":{"text":"つまり、通貨があれば……たとえばキラキラカカオを二個ほしい場合、わざわざ獣肉一枚で十個交換しなくてもいいということですね？","source_cn":"有了货币，只需要两颗斑斓可可的时候，就不用拿一整块兽肉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x898B08C6DFFE380E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1541119013:1":{"text":"ええ、その通りです。","source_cn":"没错，是这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1433B1AFA7080034","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1541119014:1":{"text":"通貨は人々の智慧の結晶であり、文明が一定の段階まで発展すると、必ず現れる物なのです。","source_cn":"货币是凡人智慧的结晶，也是文明发展到一定阶段必然出现的产物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x503153DCF519838D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1541119015:1":{"text":"ヤクボルは狩りや採取で得た戦利品や食べ物を一カ所に集め、各自の功績に応じて、ひとりひとりに分配していますが、それだと全員が望む物を手に入れられるとは限らないでしょう？だから、物々交換の市場ができたのです。","source_cn":"虽然雅库伯尔会将狩猎和采集获得的战利品和食物都汇总到一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53E4D63BBC222084","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1541119016:1":{"text":"はい。でも通貨は、交換より便利です。","source_cn":"嗯，货币很方便，比交换更方便。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4BBA5CE4A179614","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1541119017:1":{"text":"ヤクボルにも通貨が必要だと、ゴーダンさまとモンドさまに言ってみます。","source_cn":"我会告诉戈丹和蒙多，雅库伯尔也需要货币。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D38350F6C2A6679","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"通貨とはお金のことだよ。","source_cn":"货币就是钱","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x251AC4CE6477D071","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"通貨とはお金のことだよ。","female":"通貨とはお金のことよ。","variant_male_record_index":"79225","variant_female_record_index":"79226","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1541119007:1":{"text":"い、いっぱん……？","source_cn":"一般等……家务？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DC707DD022AAE75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"一般等価物だよ。","source_cn":"是一般等价物","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEF4616F84BBA3B3B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"一般等価物だよ。","female":"一般等価物よ。","variant_male_record_index":"79227","variant_female_record_index":"79228","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:加拉":{"text":"ガーラ","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"初代